<title>FRANCE: Soc Gen has 5.1 pct of Accor voting rights.</title>
<headline>Soc Gen has 5.1 pct of Accor voting rights.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>French bank Societe Generale has indirectly increased its stake in hotel group Accor to 1.99 million voting rights representing 5.09 percent of the total, the French stockmarkets association SBF said on Monday.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that Societe Generale informed the SBF on Friday that it had breached the five percent threshold.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
